# ModuleSR is the fresh "Erie Metroplex" module (two-module layout, see README.md).
# Its own content lives in are/ git/ gic/ ifo/ fac/ jrl/ and uti/ and is committed.
# Everything below is materialized at pack time by PackModuleSR.cmd and must NOT
# be committed:

# Script scaffolding is mirrored from ../Module at pack time, never duplicated here.
/ncs/
/nss/
/dlg/

# Empty resource folders the packer requires to exist (SWLOR.CLI enumerates all 16).
# The clean arrival currently needs no module conversations.
/itp/
/utc/
/utd/
/utm/
/utp/
/uts/
/utt/
/utw/

# Build output.
/packing/
*.mod
*.packing.mod
*.release.json
